       "en": "there I found a lump of snow,"
      },
      {
       "cyr": "на грутка велам, говорам,",
       "lat": "na grutka velam, govoram,",
       "en": "I say to the lump, I speak,"
      },
      {
       "cyr": "на грутка велам, говорам:",
       "lat": "na grutka velam, govoram:",
       "en": "I say to the lump, I speak:"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "lines": [
      {
